<title>PORTUGAL: PT share trade suspended - bourse.</title>
<headline>PT share trade suspended - bourse.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in Portugal Telecom (PT) shares was suspended on Lisbon bourse following an unexplained surge in the price, a Lisbon bourse official said.</p>
<p>Officials said they suspected a wrongly inserted price.</p>
</text>
